        "title": "[Enhancement] Implement graceful fallback logic for config snapshots on temporary directory locks",
        "body": "The configuration snapshot manager fails closed if any configuration file read throws a transient error (e.g. temporary filesystem lock). This halts core configuration updates and breaks CLI commands.\n\nProposed Solution:\nIntroduce graceful fallbacks (e.g. non-fatal warning logging or secondary temp locations) so that temporary snapshot failures do not block the active configuration write process.\n\nSource Reference:\nsrc/config/backup-rotation.ts#L125-L149",
